field called statistics,

00:10:57.751 --> 00:10:58.900
and studies things like, well,

00:10:58.901 --> 00:11:01.160
if I'm making many,

00:11:01.161 --> 00:11:03.600
many decisions, not just
one or a sequence of them.

00:11:03.601 --> 00:11:05.940
Here's kind of your
classic little cartoon.

00:11:05.941 --> 00:11:08.110
Someone says
