00:11:11.011 --> 00:11:12.955
put 50 in the
jelly beans category

00:11:12.956 --> 00:11:14.170
and 50 in the no jelly beans.

00:11:14.171 --> 00:11:16.040
And six weeks later I look at
their skin and see if they

00:11:16.041 --> 00:11:18.595
develop acne and one
condition of the other.

00:11:18.596 --> 00:11:21.690
No high probability,
that didn't happen.

00:11:21.691 --> 00:11:23.475
You say, no, that didn't cause,

00:11:23.476 --> 00:11:25.050
jelly beans doesn't cause acne.

00:11:25.051 --> 00:11:26.580
But then someone comes
back and says, "Well,

00:11:26.581 --> 00:11:28.950
we got to look deeper.

00:11:28.951 --> 00:11:30.725
There maybe a certain
color causes it."

00:11:30.726 --> 00:11:31.270
So now they do

00:11:31.271 --> 00:11:33.460
all the experiments for
all the different colors.

00:11:33.461 --> 00:11:35.465
You know what happens is that,

00:11:35.466 --> 00:11:37.070
at some point, by chance alone,

00:11:37.071 --> 00:11:38.970
the people who already had
a bad skin condition get put

00:11:38.971 --> 00:11:41.295
in the treatment and
everybody else in control.

00:11:41.296 --> 00:11:42.985
And it looks like
by chance alone,

00:11:42.986 --> 00:11:46.955
that green jelly beans
are linked to acne.

00:11:46.956 --> 00:11:48.520
Then the scientists getting all

00:11:48.521 --> 00:11:50.010
excited because this
is a surprising thing.

00:11:50.011 --> 00:11:51.570
They publish it, the journals are

00:11:51.571 --> 00:11:53.220
happy to publish it
because it's surprising

00:11:53.221 --> 00:11:54.930
the journalists pick up on it

00:11:54.931 --> 00:11:57.130
and everybody's
all excited about.

00:11:57.131 --> 00:11:58.235
This is until all dies down.

00:11:58.236 --> 00:11:59.530
All right. And so,
we're awash in this.

00:11:59.531 --> 00:12:02.620
Yet, if it's just
journalism and so on and

00:12:02.621 --> 00:12:07.160
health or diet, who cares?

00:12:07.161 --> 00:12:09.545
But, if it's medicine and

00:12:09.546 --> 00:12:12.130
finance and commerce and
things that really matter,

00:12:12.131 --> 00:12:13.630
this really matters a whole lot.

00:12:13.631 --> 00:12:16.090
So, how many of you all know

00:12:16.091 --> 00:12:18.415
about false discovery rate
and just a sort of time?

00:12:18.416 --> 00:12:19.970
Yeah. Everybody here good.

