strong assumptions.

00:13:01.541 --> 00:13:03.495
It assumed that you
had independence

00:13:03.496 --> 00:13:05.500
and no logical constraints.

00:13:05.501 --> 00:13:07.745
As time has gone on,
boy, I'm surprised.

