Then based on that data,

00:20:00.081 --> 00:20:03.825
I would go give a concert and
I could maybe make $25,000.

00:20:03.826 --> 00:20:05.170
If I do that three times during

00:20:05.171 --> 00:20:06.690
the year, I have a salary.

00:20:06.691 --> 00:20:08.105
I don't have to drive a taxi

00:20:08.106 --> 00:20:09.510
during the week and make
music on the weekends.

00:20:09.511 --> 00:20:10.750
I have a salary suddenly.

00:20:10.751 --> 00:20:12.770
Moreover, there's a connection
now again between

00:20:12.771 --> 00:20:15.085
the merchants and the consumer.

00:20:15.086 --> 00:20:17.280
The musician now knows
who listens to him or

00:20:17.281 --> 00:20:19.175
her. They can make
offers to them.

00:20:19.176 --> 00:20:20.830
I'll play your
daughter's wedding for

00:20:20.831 --> 00:20:23.915
$10,000 or you can come
backstage and so on.

00:20:23.916 --> 00:20:25.375
So, I now have a market,

00:20:25.376 --> 00:20:27.460
and I can price
things and compete

00:20:27.461 --> 00:20:30.535
and have points and loyalty
programs and you name it.

00:20:30.536 --> 00:20:32.740
Now, people can have jobs, right?

00:20:32.741 --> 00:20:35.215
We don't have musicians who
have jobs mostly right now.

00:20:35.216 --> 00:20:37.720
I know a lot of musicians
and none of them have jobs.

00:20:37.721 --> 00:20:39.040
Except the top 100 like

00:20:39.041 --> 00:20:40.640
Beyonce that are getting
promoted to death.

00:20:40.641 --> 00:20:42.590
So, computer science can

00:20:42.591 --> 00:20:44.625
be done to do that if you
partner with economics,

00:20:44.626 --> 00:20:46.235
and data science data

00:20:46.236 --> 00:20:47.920
is the thing that
glues it all together.

00:20:47.921 --> 00:20:51.760
Okay. I think I'm going
to skip this other one.

00:20:51.761 --> 00:20:59.120
It's another kind of
a business about economics.

00:20:59.121 --> 00:21:01.500
Yeah, I think I'll skip this one.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:05.280
Okay. So, I had a list of
challenges there and I picked

00:21:05.281 --> 00:21:06.390
a couple that I just want to talk

00:21:06.391 --> 00:21:08.225
about that brought
