I mentioned that before.

00:53:41.566 --> 00:53:43.530
Taking this continuous
time presparody

00:53:43.531 --> 00:53:45.480
is Hamiltonian
presparody if you will,

00:53:45.481 --> 00:53:47.450
helps fill the answer
this question.

00:53:47.451 --> 00:53:49.580
Okay, so let's kind
