00:55:31.611 --> 00:55:33.085
It's like gradient descent,

00:55:33.086 --> 00:55:35.010
but not just pure stochasticity,

00:55:35.011 --> 00:55:36.240
it adds Brownian
motion directly to

00:55:36.241 --> 00:55:38.240
